@startuml phase0
title Faz 0 - God Class (3v3 Elemental Dovus)

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontStyle bold

class Character {
  + name: str
  + element: str    // "fire" | "cryo" | "electro" | "hydro"
  + ability_name: str
  + hp: int
  + max_hp: int
  + attack_power: int
  + is_player: bool
  + frozen_turns: int
}

class GameEngine {
  + player_team: List<Character>
  + enemy_team: List<Character>
  + turn: int
  + log: List<str>
  + game_over: bool
  + winner: str
  --
  + create_character(name, element, ability_name, is_player) : Character
  -- if-elif: element basina taban stat
  --
  + attack(attacker, target) : void
  -- 1) taban hasar (element if-elif)
  -- 2) REAKSIYON if-elif zinciri (6 dal):
  --    Fire->Cryo  : 2x
  --    Electro->Fire: ana + %75 sicrama (rasgele baska dusman)
  --    Hydro->Electro: 1.5x, takima boler
  --    Cryo->Hydro : freeze 1 tur
  --    Fire->Hydro : 1.5x
  --    Hydro->Fire : 1.5x
  --
  + use_ability(character) : void
  -- if-elif: ability_name'e gore inline gov
  --   fire_blast | freeze_ray | thunder_chain | tidal_wave
  -- (KOD KOKUSU: fire_blast icinde character.element gecici mutasyon)
  --
  + enemy_decide(enemy) : void
  -- tek tip AI, davranis varyanti yok
  + tick_status(character) : bool
  -- if frozen_turns > 0: skip turn
  + render() : void
  -- print() ile takimlari yazdirir
  + run_turn() : void  -- main.py icinde dagilmis
}

GameEngine "1" *-- "0..*" Character : player_team
GameEngine "1" *-- "0..*" Character : enemy_team

note right of GameEngine
  **Tespit edilen sorunlar (PROBLEMS.md):**
  1. God Class: yaratim, hasar, reaksiyon, ability,
     AI, status, render hepsi burada
  2. Element type-check: 4 metoda yayilmis if-elif
  3. Reaksiyon kurallari hard-coded (6 elif dal)
  4. Yetenekler ability_name'e bagimli dispatch
  5. AI tek tipli, varyant yok
  6. Status efektleri (frozen_turns) Character'da;
     yenisi eklemek = patch
  7. Takim kavrami yok (iki ayri liste)
  8. Test edilemez (saf fonksiyon yok)
  9. UI motora gomulu (render = print)
  10. fire_blast geciici element mutasyonu (kod kokusu)
end note

note bottom of Character
  Tek sinif. element ve ability_name STRING ile
  ayrilan davranis - polimorfizm yok.
  frozen_turns alani simdiden burada;
  burning/wet/charged eklemek = patlama.
end note

@enduml
